      <h1>How to Build an AI Agent in 2026 (No Code Required)</h1>
      <p class="lede">A practical guide to building an AI agent in 2026 without code. The 5 platforms, the 7-step build process, the 4 use cases, and the 3 things to avoid. By the end of this guide, you will have built your first working AI agent.</p>
