    <section class="blog-content">
      <p>AI agents are the most important development in 2026. The no-code tools have finally caught up - you can build a useful AI agent in an afternoon, no engineering background required. This guide walks you through the entire process: choosing a platform, designing the agent, building it, testing it, and deploying it. By the end, you will have a working AI agent you built yourself.</p>

      
      <Chart type="timeline" title="Learning Path" data={[
